  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2003-06-13.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 10 songs; 60 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer drove from Chicago with a friend, Tony, enduring over twelve hours of traffic getting into Bonnaroo [2]\n- Tony wandered off to non-music activities while others in the reviewer's group spent time vending and partying [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2003-06-13.shnf**: taped by Jeff Frank; transferred by Jamie Syrek; source: AKG 483 > Lunatec V3 > Sony D8 [1]",
